- `codetools`: tool file eager CODE-TOOLS §2–§5 — `read_file` (halaman 16.000/4.000 char, tail mundur, indeks baris + async > 8 MiB, deteksi encoding/BOM/UTF-16, byte invalid `\xNN`, deteksi biner/magic, outline `go/ast` + heuristik, cache baca LRU + rilis idle), `grep` (walker paralel berurut deterministik, engine gitignore sendiri, literal fast-path + RE2, mode matches/files/count, context, jendela 500 char), `glob` (doublestar, sort path/mtime), `edit_file` (exact-only, multi-edit atomik, kandidat `no_match` informatif, `stale_read` + rentang berubah, line-range), `write_file` (temp + fsync file + rename + fsync dir, read-back sha256, overwrite dengan tag + `stale_read`, preservasi mode/owner/xattr, kunci per identitas file, pembersihan temp yatim) (ADR-103).
- `sandbox`: `Denied` dan `OpenResolved` untuk walker grep/glob (satu `openat2` `RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS` + cek identitas deny pasca-open) (ADR-103).
